Error [E0926]: This daily schedule isn't a plain `"HH:MM"` time
  --> tests/ui/schedule_bad_wallclock_format.jet:3:14
    |
  3 | #[Job, Every("3:00")] fn prune_sessions() {
    |              ^^^^^^
 Why: A wall-clock trigger is exactly two digits, a colon, and two digits — 24h time, no seconds, no timezone.
 Fix: Write a fixed daily time like `#Every("03:00")`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0926
